    aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc      ABSENT  (an AArch64 GCC)

  -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  THE SPECIFICATIONS, AS ORACLES -- QUOTED, never measured here
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------
    ARM DDI 0487, "A64 Instruction Set"                 
        the Advanced SIMD groups, the size and Q fields, the structure load
    ARM DDI 0487, "A64 Advanced SIMD"                   
        ld1/ld2/ld3/ld4 and their stride
    ARM DDI 0597, "AArch64 Pseudocode"                  
